{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102310","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310231001:0":{"text":"第一次神魔大戦の時、この地の人たちは、ラズベリーを包んだ雪玉を投げ合い、崩れた雪玉と赤いベリーをカタストロフの頭部に見立てていました。","source_cn":"据说第一次神魔战争时，这里的人会用雪球包裹着树莓互相投...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2300B39CD87F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310231002:1":{"text":"強大な敵に対抗する術のない一般人は、こうした形でカタストロフへの憎しみを現していたのです。","source_cn":"毕竟，普通人的力量远远无法与恶魔对抗，只能用这种方式来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x016EC68EB3EDAA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310231003:1":{"text":"その後、かの偉大なる女将軍のおかげで、人々はカタストロフに打ち勝ちました。","source_cn":"后来因为那位伟大的女将军，人们终于战胜了恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2145587F0AD50271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310231004:1":{"text":"ですが雪玉を投げる習慣はそれ以降も続き、祭典の重要な儀式の一つとなったのです！","source_cn":"但投掷雪球的习俗就这么保留了下来，成为庆典上重要的仪式之一！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C64AA526DE62D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"祭典のスタッフ","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}